Alaloth - Champions of The Four Kingdoms is a designer game with creative support from cult creator Chris Avellone.
Users will experience a colorful fantasy world created by RPG legend Chris Avvelon.

Download Alaloth - Champions of The Four Kingdoms Download the torrent for free in Russian and immerse yourself in a deep narrative with incredible dynamics and meticulously crafted gameplay. A mixture of blood and magic awaits you, along with one of the most brutal combat systems ever, and a new isometric world. Experience spectacular, large-scale battles, spectacular executions and mutilations, and encounters with bloodthirsty enemies, sneaky dwarves, and dangerous dragons. Forget about mindless crowds of stupid mobs rushing at you like cannon fodder. This game requires logical and strategic thinking, calculating your every move.

Furthermore, your abilities in the game are limited by your gear and ammunition. For example, you can't equip three or four different types of equipment at once or wield weapons for different purposes. Your abilities are also limited by the weight of items you can carry. According to the game rules, you can carry either two swords or one weapon and a shield. With careful loot placement, you can also fit healing potions, which are worth their weight in gold. Only clerics possess magical healing skills, so extra health potions are a good idea.

Key features of the game:
- the first isometric game that combines vibrant, dynamic controls with fun, hardcore battles;
- dungeon exploration is successfully combined with a constant wave of battles;
- the game has an editor for customizing your character: choose a class, assign skills, and upgrade talents;
- create new types of weapons, unlock new locations and tasks;
- reputation is important, so think carefully before making a decision;
- local multiplayer can be played by up to 4 players simultaneously;
- Join groups to make the gameplay more intense and interesting, and also gain access to the final battle for the most desperate;
- choose from 4 races (orcs, humans, elves and dwarves);
- you can choose which of the 40 clans to fight for: each has its own history, intrigues and tasks;
- overcome adversity side by side with 12 companions, each with their own story, skills and talents;
- Beware of huge dragons that are not interested in your successful completion of missions.

Installation:
1. Install the game following the setup instructions.
2. Install add-ons.
3. Run the game.

Add-ons:
- Ultimate Pack
- Supporter Pack
- Rimeward Set Armor Pack
